<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11480" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρα-μύθητος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be
				persuaded</i> or <i>entreated, inexorable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Epin.</u>
				980d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.629a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>incorrigible,</i> in Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					731d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of
			conditions, <i>comfortless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.332d
			</span></i>; <i>not admitting consolation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					8.245c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					1.14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>inconsolable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.33
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					8.252a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
